      "achieved error",
      "weighted invariant defects",
      "actual work",
      "single-thread elapsed",
      "workspace/storage",
      "applicability"
    ],
    "dominance": "Compare only same problem, reference, accuracy budget and execution cohort. Unknown dimensions prevent dominance. Different support requires separate portfolio branches.",
    "backpropagation": "Parent records verified leaves, failures, unresolved eligibility, Pareto set, without averaging away a failed correctness condition.",
    "pruning": "Local scope only; no strong universal no-go."
  },
